{"id":"662664","name":"竹笋炒豆角","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/662664/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆角","amount":"300g"},{"name":"竹笋","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"20g"},{"name":"姜","amount":"5g"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"5g"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜竹笋，备用。","img":"images/662664/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"竹笋洗净，切片。","img":"images/662664/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅置火上，加水烧开，放竹笋焯一下。","img":"images/662664/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞起。","img":"images/662664/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入盘中。","img":"images/662664/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"豆角去筋，洗净，掰成段。","img":"images/662664/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅置火上，加水烧开，放豆角焯一下，捞起。","img":"images/662664/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入盘中。","img":"images/662664/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"姜和蒜切片，备用。","img":"images/662664/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"红辣椒洗净，切段，备用。","img":"images/662664/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅置火上，放油烧热，放入姜片、蒜片、红辣椒段炒香，再放入豆角、笋片炒熟，最后加入盐、鸡精调味即可。","img":"images/662664/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盛入盘中。","img":"images/662664/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"降脂的山中美味。","img":"images/662664/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}